**`packages/shared/src/project-mentions.ts`** (`parseSkillMentionHref`, ~L122–141):

```ts
const skillId = `${url.hostname}${url.pathname}`.replace(/^\/+/, "").trim();
// ...
return {
  skillId,
  slug: normalizeSkillSlug(url.searchParams.get("s") ?? url.searchParams.get("slug")),
};
```

Whatever sits in the hostname slot is returned as `skillId`. No UUID validation, no slug-fallback path.

**`packages/server/src/services/heartbeat.ts`** (~L274–284):

```ts
